e on just the, she wasn't going to forge it forward with the $1.2 trillion infrastructure package and now she is. Now she's reversed herself, Biden and Schumer. They all said one cannot pass without the other. One should not pass without the other, which was the progressive line. And now they're they're folding. And it seems like they're only focused on the $1.2 trillion infrastructure. And they realized $3.5 trillion spending is in serious jeopardy because of people like Joe Manchin and Kristen Sinema. And you tell me what all of this means for America and for the average person sitting at home. I",
